D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "--- 4. SPIEGAZIONE LOCALE LORE (Factual & Counterfactual Rules) ---\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "--- REGOLA FATTUALE (Factual Rule) ---\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "Se:\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "  - SDS-SDS_Total_T <= 58.85\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "  - BIA-BIA_ICW > 28.26\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "  - BIA-BIA_LST <= 64.91\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "  - Body_Proportion <= -0.04\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "Allora la classe predetta è: 3 (Severe)\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "--- SPIEGAZIONE CONTROFATTUALE (Counterfactual) ---\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "Per ottenere la classe 0 (None) invece di 3 (Severe), \n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "sarebbe necessario modificare le seguenti feature (valori reali):\n",

